# Enemy Spawner: a slow, tough hive body that holds off at StandoffRange from its target and,
# once in range, CONTINUOUSLY births Swarm bodies next to itself every FireInterval seconds
# (ShotKind 2: the "shot" is a spawn — NpcSystem::service). Kill it first or drown in swarm.
# Squat CYAN cylinder — green is the friendly tint (applyTeamTint pulls own-team units 55 % toward
# 0.3/1.0/0.4), and the authored green read as an ally. Cyan is the one hue no other enemy uses.
Prefab gameEnemySpawner
	Component Render
		ObjectContainer baseshapes
		Node Cylinder2
		Type StaticMesh
		Color 0.1 0.85 0.95
		Scale 1.2 0.7 1.2
	Component Physics
		Body Dynamic
		Shape Sphere
		Radius 1.2
		Density 300
		Friction 0
		LockRotation true
		ContactEvents true
	Component Force
		Team 1
		Output 1.0
		Reach 4
		Centered true
	Component Network
	Component GameUnit
		ShortName HIVE
		HealthMax 320
		EnergyMax 100
		ShieldOutput 1.0
		MoveSpeed 2.2
		AttackInterval 1.0
		AttackDamage 0
		PlayerDamage 0
		EmitterDrain 4
		Ranged true
		StandoffRange 18
		FireInterval 1.25
		ShotKind 2
		AlwaysDisplayHealth true
